Eight virtual threads each call `merge` a thousand times on a `ConcurrentHashMap`. What does the program print?

```java
void main() {
    var counts = new ConcurrentHashMap<String, Integer>();
    try (var executor = Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()) {
        for (int t = 0; t < 8; t++) {
            executor.submit(() -> {
                for (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++) {
                    counts.merge("hits", 1, Integer::sum);
                }
            });
        }
    }
    IO.println(counts.get("hits"));
}
```

